, rung:0, rationale:"Exposes the false assumption of sudden destruction with evidence of gradual change.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_ARYAN_INVASION_DESTRUCTION_THEORY_A49AD1"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_02F71930", properties:{kc_id:"CON_DECLINE_OF_THE_INDUS_VALLEY_CIVILIZATION_2AD31B", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.112Z'), probe_text:"How do continuities in pottery styles and agricultural practices between late Harappan and early Vedic cultures complicate the invasion narrative?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.112Z'), rung:1, rationale:"Re-anchors thinking to material culture continuity evidence.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_ARYAN_INVASION_DESTRUCTION_THEORY_A49AD1"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_3E697410", properties:{kc_id:"CON_DECLINE_OF_THE_INDUS_VALLEY_CIVILIZATION_2AD31B", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.112Z'), probe_text:"Why is the sudden catastrophic collapse narrative appealing for explaining civilizational decline, and where else has this framing been misleading?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.112Z'), rung:2, rationale:"Metacognitive transfer to recognizing dramatic-narrative bias in historiography.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_ARYAN_INVASION_DESTRUCTION_THEORY_A49AD1"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_CD2FEC09", properties:{kc_id:"CON_INTERPRETING_VEDIC_TEXTS_AS_HISTORICAL_SOURCES_6AF2D2", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.114Z'), probe_text:"Over what time period were the Rigvedic hymns composed, and for what primary purpose?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.114Z'), rung:0, rationale:"Establishes the non-historical original purpose of the texts.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_VEDIC_TEXTS_AS_LITERAL_HISTORICAL_ACCOUNTS_49AF6B"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_43588703", properties:{kc_id:"CON_INTERPRETING_VEDIC_TEXTS_AS_HISTORICAL_SOURCES_6AF2D2", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.115Z'), probe_text:"What methods do historians use to extract historical information from texts that were not written as history?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.115Z'), rung:1, rationale:"Redirects to source criticism methodology.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_VEDIC_TEXTS_AS_LITERAL_HISTORICAL_ACCOUNTS_49AF6B"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_3F9C3A6B", properties:{kc_id:"CON_INTERPRETING_VEDIC_TEXTS_AS_HISTORICAL_SOURCES_6AF2D2", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.116Z'), probe_text:"What other ancient texts are commonly misread as literal history, and what interpretive caution applies?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.116Z'), rung:2, rationale:"Metacognitive transfer to source criticism across cultures.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_VEDIC_TEXTS_AS_LITERAL_HISTORICAL_ACCOUNTS_49AF6B"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_C985693D", properties:{kc_id:"CON_TRACING_AGRICULTURAL_ORIGINS_AT_MEHRGARH_ED8E0F", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.117Z'), probe_text:"What crops and animals were independently domesticated at Mehrgarh, and what is the dating evidence?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.117Z'), rung:0, rationale:"Factual disruption with specific South Asian agricultural evidence.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_FERTILE_CRESCENT_SOLE_ORIGIN_FALLACY_7FE046"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_6B9C9469", properties:{kc_id:"CON_TRACING_AGRICULTURAL_ORIGINS_AT_MEHRGARH_ED8E0F", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.118Z'), probe_text:"How does the Mehrgarh evidence challenge the single-origin diffusion model of agriculture?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.118Z'), rung:1, rationale:"Re-anchors to multi-center origin framework.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_FERTILE_CRESCENT_SOLE_ORIGIN_FALLACY_7FE046"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_824958C8", properties:{kc_id:"CON_TRACING_AGRICULTURAL_ORIGINS_AT_MEHRGARH_ED8E0F", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.119Z'), probe_text:"Why do diffusionist models tend to privilege certain regions as innovation centers, and how does this bias affect other fields?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.119Z'), rung:2, rationale:"Metacognitive recognition of Eurocentric diffusionist bias.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_FERTILE_CRESCENT_SOLE_ORIGIN_FALLACY_7FE046"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_07631F94", properties:{kc_id:"CON_EVALUATING_ASHOKAN_EDICTS_AS_ADMINISTRATIVE_EVID_E85AD6", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.12Z'), probe_text:"What do Ashoka's edicts say about his continued maintenance of military forces and frontier administration after the Kalinga war?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.12Z'), rung:0, rationale:"Disrupts the pure pacifist narrative with textual evidence.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_ASHOKA_AS_PACIFIST_RULER_MYTH_187E25"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_AD7E5FC7", properties:{kc_id:"CON_EVALUATING_ASHOKAN_EDICTS_AS_ADMINISTRATIVE_EVID_E85AD6", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.121Z'), probe_text:"How does the concept of dhamma function as a political tool for imperial consolidation rather than purely religious conversion?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.121Z'), rung:1, rationale:"Re-anchors to political interpretation of royal ideology.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_ASHOKA_AS_PACIFIST_RULER_MYTH_187E25"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_44FBFCD4", properties:{kc_id:"CON_EVALUATING_ASHOKAN_EDICTS_AS_ADMINISTRATIVE_EVID_E85AD6", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.122Z'), probe_text:"Why do students tend to take royal proclamations at face value, and how does this apply to other rulers' self-representations?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.122Z'), rung:2, rationale:"Metacognitive transfer to critical reading of state propaganda.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_ASHOKA_AS_PACIFIST_RULER_MYTH_187E25"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_5E2651B4", properties:{kc_id:"CON_COMPARING_MAURYAN_AND_ARTHASHASTRA_ADMINISTRATIV_56CAF1", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.123Z'), probe_text:"When was the Arthashastra composed, and how does its dating complicate its use as evidence for Chandragupta's actual administration?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.123Z'), rung:0, rationale:"Establishes the text's complex authorship history.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_ARTHASHASTRA_AS_MAURYAN_CONSTITUTION_FALLACY_5768C1"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_862A008E", properties:{kc_id:"CON_COMPARING_MAURYAN_AND_ARTHASHASTRA_ADMINISTRATIV_56CAF1", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.124Z'), probe_text:"What archaeological evidence from Mauryan sites either supports or contradicts specific Arthashastra prescriptions?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.124Z'), rung:1, rationale:"Redirects to material evidence vs textual prescription.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_ARTHASHASTRA_AS_MAURYAN_CONSTITUTION_FALLACY_5768C1"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_73F2B38F", properties:{kc_id:"CON_COMPARING_MAURYAN_AND_ARTHASHASTRA_ADMINISTRATIV_56CAF1", course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.125Z'), probe_text:"How does the distinction between prescriptive and descriptive sources apply to other historical legal and political texts?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:52.125Z'), rung:2, rationale:"Metacognitive transfer to source typology.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_ARTHASHASTRA_AS_MAURYAN_CONSTITUTION_FALLACY_5768C1"}}, {probe