rangement whereby two or more companies create a single enterprise or project Which concrete detail contradicts this claim about joint venture: A joint venture is simply a supplier contract without a shared enterprise.", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:38.912Z'), rung:0, rationale:"Requires a concrete source detail that falsifies the stated assumption about joint venture.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_JOINT_VENTURE_DIAGNOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_381_E263C2"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_4A712772", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", probe_text:"Using the framework of entering the global arena, how would you explain joint venture correctly, and which distinction does the flawed claim erase?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:38.912Z'), rung:1, rationale:"Re-establishes the relevant marketing relationship or classification. Evidence to use: a business arrangement whereby two or more companies create a single enterprise or project", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_JOINT_VENTURE_DIAGNOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_381_E263C2"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_0EAEDE5A", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", probe_text:"If you applied this claim about joint venture to a different product, customer group, or organization, what evidence would you check before accepting it, and what result would make you reject it?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:38.912Z'), rung:2, rationale:"Transfers the identified reasoning error to a new marketing decision while requiring a falsifiable check rather than copying the claim: A joint venture is simply a supplier contract without a shared enterprise.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_JOINT_VENTURE_DIAGNOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_381_E263C2"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_846CA449", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", probe_text:"The source evidence is: a contract in which one organization permits another to use its name brand or trademark on its own items Which concrete de