idence is: community composed of individuals who express a diversity of genders, preferences, and sexual orientations that include lesbian, gay, bisexual, transsexual, queer/questioning, intersex, asexual, and other sexual identities Which concrete detail contradicts this claim about lgbtqia+ population: All LGBTQIA+ customers have identical identities, needs, and purchase preferences.", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:38.912Z'), rung:0, rationale:"Requires a concrete source detail that falsifies the stated assumption about lgbtqia+ population.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_LGBTQIA_POPULATION_DIAGNOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_413_4023C0"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_C203FF38", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", probe_text:"Using the framework of marketing to sociodemographic groups, how would you explain lgbtqia+ population correctly, and which distinction does the flawed claim erase?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:38.912Z'), rung:1, rationale:"Re-establishes the relevant marketing relationship or classification. Evidence to use: community composed of individuals who express a diversity of genders, preferences, and sexual orientations that include lesbian, gay, bisexual, transsexual, queer/questioning, intersex, asexual, and other sexual identities", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_LGBTQIA_POPULATION_DIAGNOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_413_4023C0"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_AA342DE2", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", probe_text:"If you applied this claim about lgbtqia+ population to a different product, customer group, or organization, what evidence would you check before accepting it, and what result would make you reject it?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:38.912Z'), rung:2, rationale:"Transfers the identified reasoning error to a new marketing decision while requiring a falsifiable check rather than copying the claim: All LGBTQIA+ customers have identical identities, needs, and purchase preference