oducts to a national brand and labeled privately", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_PRIVATE_LABEL_BRANDS_DIAGNOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_45_A99DB8"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_63F57FB6", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", probe_text:"If you applied this claim about private-label brands to a different product, customer group, or organization, what evidence would you check before accepting it, and what result would make you reject it?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:39.073Z'), rung:2, rationale:"Transfers the identified reasoning error to a new marketing decision while requiring a falsifiable check rather than copying the claim: Private labels must always be inferior to manufacturer brands.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_PRIVATE_LABEL_BRANDS_DIAGNOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_45_A99DB8"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_07C61E7B", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", probe_text:"The source evidence is: a particular good that a company sells Which concrete detail contradicts this claim about product item: A product item is the firm's complete portfolio.", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:39.073Z'), rung:0, rationale:"Requires a concrete source detail that falsifies the stated assumption about product item.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_PRODUCT_ITEM_DIAGNOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_460_25EFAB"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_FF839CC0", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", probe_text:"Using the framework of product items, product lines, and product mixes, how would you explain product item correctly, and which distinction does the flawed claim erase?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:39.073Z'), rung:1, rationale:"Re-establishes the relevant marketing relationship or classification. Evidence to use: a particular good that a company sells", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_PRODUCT_ITEM_DIAGNOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_460_25EFAB"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_62C66EF6", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49d