NOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_683_6B6666"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_9E7C15EE", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", probe_text:"If you applied this claim about unaided recall to a different product, customer group, or organization, what evidence would you check before accepting it, and what result would make you reject it?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:39.392Z'), rung:2, rationale:"Transfers the identified reasoning error to a new marketing decision while requiring a falsifiable check rather than copying the claim: Supplying brand names before questioning leaves recall unaided.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_UNAIDED_RECALL_DIAGNOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_683_6B6666"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_B481F20A", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", probe_text:"The source evidence is: an approach to personal selling in which selling behaviors are altered during the sales interaction or across customer interactions, based on information about the nature of the selling situation Which concrete detail contradicts this claim about adaptive selling: Adaptive selling uses exactly the same presentation for every customer.", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:39.392Z'), rung:0, rationale:"Requires a concrete source detail that falsifies the stated assumption about adaptive selling.", status:"approved", misconception_id:"MISC_ADAPTIVE_SELLING_DIAGNOSTIC_MISCONCEPTION_684_798910"}}, {probe_id:"PROBE_402BBD66", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", probe_text:"Using the framework of steps in the personal selling process, how would you explain adaptive selling correctly, and which distinction does the flawed claim erase?", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:39.392Z'), rung:1, rationale:"Re-establishes the relevant marketing relationship or classification. Evidence to use: an approach to personal selling in which selling behaviors are altered during the sales interaction or across customer interactions, based on inf