ng evidence from Mehrgarh excavations for the independent development of agriculture and animal husbandry in South Asia from 7000 BCE onward.", label:"Tracing Agricultural Origins at Mehrgarh", canonical_key:"TRACING_AGRICULTURAL_ORIGINS_AT_MEHRGARH", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"CON_EVALUATING_ASHOKAN_EDICTS_AS_ADMINISTRATIVE_EVID_E85AD6", kc_id:"CON_EVALUATING_ASHOKAN_EDICTS_AS_ADMINISTRATIVE_EVID_E85AD6", properties:{course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", bloom_level:"evaluate", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:51.601Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"method", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:51.601Z'), definition:"Analyzing Ashoka's rock and pillar edicts as primary sources for understanding Mauryan governance, dhamma policy, territorial extent, and the relationship between royal ideology and actual administrative practice.", label:"Evaluating Ashokan Edicts as Administrative Evidence", canonical_key:"EVALUATING_ASHOKAN_EDICTS_AS_ADMINISTRATIVE_EVID", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"CON_COMPARING_MAURYAN_AND_ARTHASHASTRA_ADMINISTRATIV_56CAF1", kc_id:"CON_COMPARING_MAURYAN_AND_ARTHASHASTRA_ADMINISTRATIV_56CAF1", properties:{course_id:"2bf5b7c4-01ee-4ee5-9c8b-f2066289192a", bloom_level:"analyze", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:51.603Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"relationship", created_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:01:51.603Z'), definition:"Comparing the idealized statecraft in Kautilya's Arthashastra with archaeological and epigraphic evidence of actual Mauryan governance, taxation, espionage, and provincial administration.", label:"Comparing Mauryan and Arthashastra Administrative Models", canonical_key:"COMPARING_MAURYAN_AND_ARTHASHASTRA_ADMINISTRATIV", status:"approved"}}] AS row
