UNWIND [{concept_id:"dad2c925-20ad-5919-a1f4-4cfd298b1495", kc_id:"dad2c925-20ad-5919-a1f4-4cfd298b1495", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"method", definition:"Section 2.5, printed page 81, chapter 2 (Strategic Planning in Marketing). Learning outcomes: Explain the importance of ethical marketing. Describe key ethical considerations in strategic planning. Discuss examples of ethical companies.", label:"Ethical Issues in Developing a Marketing Strategy", canonical_key:"ethical_issues_in_developing_a_marketing_strateg", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"893b64c4-2085-51ad-bf52-7b7e689371a8", kc_id:"893b64c4-2085-51ad-bf52-7b7e689371a8", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 3.1, printed page 94, chapter 3 (Consumer Markets and Purchasing Behavior). Learning outcomes: Define consumer buying behavior. Explain the nature of the buyer’s black box. Describe how consumer behavior is characterized into types.", label:"Understanding Consumer Markets and Buying Behavior", canonical_key:"understanding_consumer_markets_and_buying_behavi", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"342a3d5d-0a4a-5323-b195-ee0cbac5b7f5", kc_id:"342a3d5d-0a4a-5323-b195-ee0cbac5b7f5", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 3.2, printed page 97, chapter 3 (Consumer Markets and Purchasing Behavior). Learning outcomes: List and describe the cultural factors that influence consumer buying behavior. Explain the social factors that impact consumer buying behavior. Discuss the personal factors that influence consumer buying behavior. Describe the psychological factors that influence consumer buying behavior. Explain situational factors that impact consumer buying behavior.", label:"Factors That Influence Consumer Buying Behavior", canonical_key:"factors_that_influence_consumer_buying_behavior", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"62c90fb4-ac9f-5beb-9a16-5593989e857b", kc_id:"62c90fb4-ac9f-5beb-9a16-5593989e857b", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"method", definition:"Section 3.3, printed page 111, chapter 3 (Consumer Markets and Purchasing Behavior). Learning outcomes: Explain the first stage in the consumer purchasing decision process. Summarize the second stage in the consumer purchasing decision process. Describe the third stage in the consumer purchasing decision process. Discuss the fourth stage in the consumer purchasing decision process. Explain the fifth and final stage in the consumer purchasing decision process.", label:"The Consumer Purchasing Decision Process", canonical_key:"the_consumer_purchasing_decision_process", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"6cb19edd-fc5e-5621-8f17-7ea442feff6b", kc_id:"6cb19edd-fc5e-5621-8f17-7ea442feff6b", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 3.4, printed page 116, chapter 3 (Consumer Markets and Purchasing Behavior). Learning outcomes: Describe ethical issues related to consumer buying behavior. Identify the characteristics of an ethical consumer.", label:"Ethical Issues in Consumer Buying Behavior", canonical_key:"ethical_issues_in_consumer_buying_behavior", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"17acf9e2-d565-5dc9-a94c-467d5de5c7b6", kc_id:"17acf9e2-d565-5dc9-a94c-467d5de5c7b6", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 4.1, printed page 128, chapter 4 (Business Markets and Purchasing Behavior). Learning outcomes: Define the business-to-business (B2B) market. Distinguish characteristics of the B2B market versus the business-to-consumer (B2C) market.", label:"The Business-to-Business (B2B) Market", canonical_key:"the_business_to_business_b2b_market", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"3609f850-deb0-511d-9358-8bcd5b6af313", kc_id:"3609f850-deb0-511d-9358-8bcd5b6af313", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 4.2, printed page 131, chapter 4 (Business Markets and Purchasing Behavior). Learning outcomes: Identify the types of buyers involved in the B2B market. Describe the types of buying situations that exist in the B2B market. List and describe the parties who participate in the B2B buying process.", label:"Buyers and Buying Situations in a B2B Market", canonical_key:"buyers_and_buying_situations_in_a_b2b_market", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"ebfa60fb-394b-5663-b027-7ddd630bb8d6", kc_id:"ebfa60fb-394b-5663-b027-7ddd630bb8d6", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 4.3, printed page 138, chapter 4 (Business Markets and Purchasing Behavior). Learning outcomes: List and describe the external influences on B2B buyer behavior. Explain the internal factors that influence B2B buyer behavior. Examine the individual factors that impact B2B buyer behavior. List and describe the interpersonal factors that influence B2B buyer behavior. Explain the conditional factors that impact B2B buyer behavior.", label:"Major Influences on B2B Buyer Behavior", canonical_key:"major_influences_on_b2b_buyer_behavior", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"bb111985-ba03-575a-b971-9837ff8ec3c7", kc_id:"bb111985-ba03-575a-b971-9837ff8ec3c7", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"method", definition:"Section 4.4, printed page 141, chapter 4 (Business Markets and Purchasing Behavior). Learning outcomes: Explain and describe the stages in the B2B buying process.", label:"Stages in the B2B Buying Process", canonical_key:"stages_in_the_b2b_buying_process", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"4a99b3f7-4f69-540c-b987-4c479c1fbd62", kc_id:"4a99b3f7-4f69-540c-b987-4c479c1fbd62", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 4.5, printed page 144, chapter 4 (Business Markets and Purchasing Behavior). Learning outcomes: Discuss ethical issues pertaining to B2B marketing. Explain the Foreign Corrupt Practices Act. Provide an example of a company that displays ethics in B2B marketing.", label:"Ethical Issues in B2B Marketing", canonical_key:"ethical_issues_in_b2b_marketing", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"9547d740-5cef-5590-8c36-11023a3fa71a", kc_id:"9547d740-5cef-5590-8c36-11023a3fa71a", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 5.1, printed page 156, chapter 5 (Market Segmentation, Targeting, and Positioning). Learning outcomes: Define market segmentation. Describe the benefits of market segmentation. Discuss methods of segmenting consumer markets.", label:"Market Segmentation and Consumer Markets", canonical_key:"market_segmentation_and_consumer_markets", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"f3c6a19b-503b-5a9d-a6ed-74a5cfbfc1f0", kc_id:"f3c6a19b-503b-5a9d-a6ed-74a5cfbfc1f0", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 5.2, printed page 165, chapter 5 (Market Segmentation, Targeting, and Positioning). Learning outcomes: Describe the challenges of segmenting B2B markets. Discuss the advantages of segmenting B2B markets. Explain methods of segmenting B2B markets.", label:"Segmentation of B2B Markets", canonical_key:"segmentation_of_b2b_markets", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"898f92c2-1157-5c8d-9f51-dd46f6f0d898", kc_id:"898f92c2-1157-5c8d-9f51-dd46f6f0d898", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 5.3, printed page 169, chapter 5 (Market Segmentation, Targeting, and Positioning). Learning outcomes: Describe the challenges of segmenting international markets. Discuss the advantages of segmenting international markets. Explain methods of segmenting international markets.", label:"Segmentation of International Markets", canonical_key:"segmentation_of_international_markets", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"779f9d39-3d4a-5b39-bc15-0e20f6ca607d", kc_id:"779f9d39-3d4a-5b39-bc15-0e20f6ca607d", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 5.4, printed page 174, chapter 5 (Market Segmentation, Targeting, and Positioning). Learning outcomes: List and describe the essential factors in effective market segmentation.", label:"Essential Factors in Effective Market Segmentation", canonical_key:"essential_factors_in_effective_market_segmentati", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"823a7564-8c6b-5b5b-8e4b-13a7eb229a00", kc_id:"823a7564-8c6b-5b5b-8e4b-13a7eb229a00", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 5.5, printed page 175, chapter 5 (Market Segmentation, Targeting, and Positioning). Learning outcomes: Define target market. Explain target market strategies.", label:"Selecting Target Markets", canonical_key:"selecting_target_markets", status:"approved"}}, {concept_i