-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 6.2, printed page 201, chapter 6 (Marketing Research and Market Intelligence). Learning outcomes: Identify sources of marketing information. Describe the different categories of marketing information.", label:"Sources of Marketing Information", canonical_key:"sources_of_marketing_information", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"c5504a81-1fb7-57a8-b394-e7cb4c9a1db3", kc_id:"c5504a81-1fb7-57a8-b394-e7cb4c9a1db3", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"method", definition:"Section 6.3, printed page 203, chapter 6 (Marketing Research and Market Intelligence). Learning outcomes: Identify and describe the steps in a marketing research plan. Discuss the different types of data research. Explain how data is analyzed. Discuss the importance of effective research reports.", label:"Steps in a Successful Marketing Research Plan", canonical_key:"steps_in_a_successful_marketing_research_plan", status:"approved"}}] AS row
