.3, printed page 390, chapter 11 (Services: The Intangible Product). Learning outcomes: Describe the Gap Model of Service Quality. List and describe the dimensions of service quality.", label:"The Gap Model of Service Quality", canonical_key:"the_gap_model_of_service_quality", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"5561bba1-11e5-52c4-81f9-d882b5560d01", kc_id:"5561bba1-11e5-52c4-81f9-d882b5560d01", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 11.4, printed page 395, chapter 11 (Services: The Intangible Product). Learning outcomes: Describe the ethical considerations in providing services to customers. Discuss how ethics contribute to customer satisfaction.", label:"Ethical Considerations in Providing Services", canonical_key:"ethical_considerations_in_providing_services", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"ff846638-45f9-5398-9d59-525874e91049", kc_id:"ff846638-45f9-5398-9d59-525874e91049", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 12.1, printed page 406, chapter 12 (Pricing Products and Services). Learning outcomes: Define pricing. Explain pricing and its role in the marketing mix. Explain the psychology of pricing.", label:"Pricing and Its Role in the Marketing Mix", canonical_key:"pricing_and_its_role_in_the_marketing_mix", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"21585f3a-bcc0-5e53-8d3a-bfb6dc35fcbd", kc_id:"21585f3a-bcc0-5e53-8d3a-bfb6dc35fcbd", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 12.2, printed page 411, chapter 12 (Pricing Products and Services). Learning outcomes: List the five critical Cs of pricing. Characterize the five critical Cs of pricing.", label:"The Five Critical Cs of Pricing", canonic