isting_prod", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"10a3ff58-67ce-5fc4-8344-c7a02be25660", kc_id:"10a3ff58-67ce-5fc4-8344-c7a02be25660", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 12.6, printed page 427, chapter 12 (Pricing Products and Services). Learning outcomes: Identify ethical issues related to the pricing of products and services. Describe the different types of unethical practices.", label:"Ethical Considerations in Pricing", canonical_key:"ethical_considerations_in_pricing", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"b60b2402-a5eb-58c1-b7db-9e44d045ff43", kc_id:"b60b2402-a5eb-58c1-b7db-9e44d045ff43", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 13.1, printed page 438, chapter 13 (Integrated Marketing Communications). Learning outcomes: Define the promotion mix and explain its importance. List and describe the elements of the promotion mix.", label:"The Promotion Mix and Its Elements", canonical_key:"the_promotion_mix_and_its_elements", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"9f4203a2-e9be-5944-ab3a-e0c80a71051a", kc_id:"9f4203a2-e9be-5944-ab3a-e0c80a71051a", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"method", definition:"Section 13.2, printed page 446, chapter 13 (Integrated Marketing Communications). Learning outcomes: Describe the communication process. Identify and discuss each element of the communication process.", label:"The Communication Process", canonical_key:"the_communication_process", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"e276090c-f792-5117-bc50-ff133edb63e3", kc_id:"e276090c-f792-5117-bc50-ff133edb63e3", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic"