ge 508, chapter 15 (The Promotion Mix: Personal Selling and Sales Promotion). Learning outcomes: List the various roles involved in personal selling. Describe the differences between the various personal selling roles.", label:"Classifications of Salespeople Involved in Personal Selling", canonical_key:"classifications_of_salespeople_involved_in_perso", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"8c2d9b57-168b-52b5-8dec-d4cf5e821417", kc_id:"8c2d9b57-168b-52b5-8dec-d4cf5e821417", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"method", definition:"Section 15.3, printed page 511, chapter 15 (The Promotion Mix: Personal Selling and Sales Promotion). Learning outcomes: List the steps in the personal selling process. Describe each step in the personal selling process.", label:"Steps in the Personal Selling Process", canonical_key:"steps_in_the_personal_selling_process", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"8807c4ef-063f-58f5-8471-e7610267bd93", kc_id:"8807c4ef-063f-58f5-8471-e7610267bd93", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 15.4, printed page 516, chapter 15 (The Promotion Mix: Personal Selling and Sales Promotion). Learning outcomes: Identify the issues involved in managing a sales force. List the various ways a sales force can be structured. Describe the tasks involved in sales force recruitment and selection. Discuss key metrics that can be used to assess sales performance. Describe the tasks involved in supervising and evaluating a sales force. Summarize the metrics that can be used for sales force performance evaluation.", label:"Management of the Sales Force", canonical_key:"management_of_the_sales_force", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"157732b9-43e0-5cd8-a433-7d01a1466365", kc_id:"157732b9-43e0-5cd8-a433-7d01a1466365", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-