irect, Online, Social Media, and Mobile Marketing). Learning outcomes: Describe ethical issues with respect to digital marketing and social media. Explain why ethical issues exist.", label:"Ethical Issues in Digital Marketing and Social Media", canonical_key:"ethical_issues_in_digital_marketing_and_social_m", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"28c2c697-f424-5083-9dfb-75d3b23c1e1e", kc_id:"28c2c697-f424-5083-9dfb-75d3b23c1e1e", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 17.1, printed page 576, chapter 17 (Distribution: Delivering Customer Value). Learning outcomes: Describe the use of marketing channels. Identify the different types of marketing channels. Discuss how marketing intermediaries add value to products.", label:"The Use and Value of Marketing Channels", canonical_key:"the_use_and_value_of_marketing_channels", status:"approved"}}] AS row
