ed. Summarize the metrics used for channel member evaluation.", label:"Managing the Distribution Channel", canonical_key:"managing_the_distribution_channel", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"5492eaa4-bff5-5052-8959-6ed143da8d02", kc_id:"5492eaa4-bff5-5052-8959-6ed143da8d02", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 17.5, printed page 597, chapter 17 (Distribution: Delivering Customer Value). Learning outcomes: Define supply chain management (SCM). Explain the role of marketing in supply chain management. Describe the various functions of supply chain management.", label:"The Supply Chain and Its Functions", canonical_key:"the_supply_chain_and_its_functions", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"635c0413-b3b0-50be-9231-25caef7353df", kc_id:"635c0413-b3b0-50be-9231-25caef7353df", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 17.6, printed page 599, chapter 17 (Distribution: Delivering Customer Value). Learning outcomes: Define and describe logistics. Explain the functions of logistics. Describe logistics information management. Describe integrated logistics management. Characterize third-party logistics (3PL) providers.", label:"Logistics and Its Functions", canonical_key:"logistics_and_its_functions", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"ecc59c6b-160b-52f8-9886-f9a1831b6ac4", kc_id:"ecc59c6b-160b-52f8-9886-f9a1831b6ac4", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 17.7, printed page 603, chapter 17 (Distribution: Delivering Customer Value). Learning outcomes: Discuss the issue of the carbon footprint versus the speed of shipping. Discuss the issue of sourcing sustainably.", label:"Ethical Issues in Supply Chain Management", canonical_key:"ethical_issues_in_supply_chain_management", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"b467f430-da9f-5405-bb91-644c30096d2c", kc_id:"b467f430-da9f-5405-bb91-644c30096d2c", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 18.1, printed page 612, chapter 18 (Retailing and Wholesaling). Learning outcomes: Define retailing. Discuss the functions of retailers in the distribution channel.", label:"Retailing and the Role of Retailers in the Distribution Channel", canonical_key:"retailing_and_the_role_of_retailers_in_the_distr", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"afe39c14-de64-5d88-ae6d-9608772a4b2e", kc_id:"afe39c14-de64-5d88-ae6d-9608772a4b2e", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Section 18.2, printed page 617, chapter 18 (Retailing and Wholesaling). Learning outcomes: Characterize various store retailers. Characterize various non-store retailers", label:"Major Types of Retailers", canonical_key:"major_types_of_retailers", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"e542647b-8f79-57be-a4c2-b9c115d6c00c", kc_id:"e542647b-8f79-57be-a4c2-b9c115d6c00c", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"topic", concept_type:"method", definition:"Section 18.3, printed page 626, chapter 18 (Retailing and Wholesaling). Learning outcomes: Describe how pricing affects retail strategy decisions. Explain how location is a factor in retail strategy decisions. Discuss the importance of retailer communications. Explain how merchandise affects retail strategy decisions.", label:"Retailing Strategy Decisions", canonical_key:"retailing_strategy_decisions", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"76016536-3e61-561f-a4b9-aab0e5df983c", kc_id:"76016536-3e61-561f-a4b9-aab0e5d