urce: chapter 4 Key Terms, printed page 148; related section 4.2.", label:"Explain retailers", canonical_key:"explain_retailers", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"481ebc53-d42a-59c1-b73a-e3bfe1fb316b", kc_id:"481ebc53-d42a-59c1-b73a-e3bfe1fb316b", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain social environment: the values, attitudes, beliefs, wants, and desires of the consuming public Source: chapter 4 Key Terms, printed page 148; related section 4.3.", label:"Explain social environment", canonical_key:"explain_social_environment", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"172f3a24-fc18-541a-a406-f2ee8f560b58", kc_id:"172f3a24-fc18-541a-a406-f2ee8f560b58", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"process", definition:"Explain straight rebuys: purchases in which the business customer buys the same goods from the same supplier in the same quantity at the same terms and requires minimal decision making Source: chapter 4 Key Terms, printed page 148; related section 4.2.", label:"Explain straight rebuys", canonical_key:"explain_straight_rebuys", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"7a572b16-e665-5927-acf2-18652aa03837", kc_id:"7a572b16-e665-5927-acf2-18652aa03837", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"process", definition:"Explain systems selling: selling a complete solution to a problem or need rather than one or more of the component parts Source: chapter 4 Key Terms, printed page 148; related section 4.2.", label:"Explain systems selling", canonical_key:"explain_systems_selling", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"ef11a491-dea4-5795-b6f3-7b836acb407a", kc_