e: chapter 4 Key Terms, printed page 148; related section 4.3.", label:"Explain workforce skills", canonical_key:"explain_workforce_skills", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"a4fb8733-42da-53ce-b43c-e3e6d005f98a", kc_id:"a4fb8733-42da-53ce-b43c-e3e6d005f98a", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain ADAMS: the essential factors in effective market segmentation—accessible, differentiable, actionable, measurable, and substantial Source: chapter 5 Key Terms, printed page 190; related section 5.4.", label:"Explain ADAMS", canonical_key:"explain_adams", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"cadd38f6-188e-5009-bfc4-8f05c1eb5a22", kc_id:"cadd38f6-188e-5009-bfc4-8f05c1eb5a22", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain affinity audience: a group of potential customers who have interests or hobbies in common Source: chapter 5 Key Terms, printed page 190; related section 5.7.", label:"Explain affinity audience", canonical_key:"explain_affinity_audience", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"2b03de80-65ed-5320-9938-5d02179935b1", kc_id:"2b03de80-65ed-5320-9938-5d02179935b1", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"apply", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"method", definition:"Apply behavioral segmentation: method of grouping customers by their behavior patterns or interactions with a brand Source: chapter 5 Key Terms, printed page 190; related section 5.1.", label:"Apply behavioral segmentation", canonical_key:"apply_behavioral_segmentation", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"6fab7465-676d-50d7-8d21-297531f44120", kc_id:"6fab7465-676d-50d7-8d21-297531f44120", properties:{course_i