 watching consumers and recording actions Source: chapter 6 Key Terms, printed page 219; related section 6.3.", label:"Apply observational research", canonical_key:"apply_observational_research", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"b7724d08-b3f7-52e9-b9ce-bc2f39a4778d", kc_id:"b7724d08-b3f7-52e9-b9ce-bc2f39a4778d", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain one-on-one interview: an interview that happens on an individual level between researcher and respondent Source: chapter 6 Key Terms, printed page 219; related section 6.3.", label:"Explain one-on-one interview", canonical_key:"explain_one_on_one_interview", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"d28a33d0-dcc4-5131-a1f3-40c39d469370", kc_id:"d28a33d0-dcc4-5131-a1f3-40c39d469370", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain personal observations: observations that are collected by human recorders Source: chapter 6 Key Terms, printed page 219; related section 6.3.", label:"Explain personal observations", canonical_key:"explain_personal_observations", status:"approved"}}] AS row
