uggesting a purchase disguised as research Source: chapter 6 Key Terms, printed page 219; related section 6.4.", label:"Evaluate sugging", canonical_key:"evaluate_sugging", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"fb9879fb-6081-5b12-8062-1e53e99d183d", kc_id:"fb9879fb-6081-5b12-8062-1e53e99d183d", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"apply", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"method", definition:"Apply survey: also known as a questionnaire, a series of several questions that can collect a variety of qualitative and quantitative data; can be distributed through several different methods Source: chapter 6 Key Terms, printed page 219; related section 6.3.", label:"Apply survey", canonical_key:"apply_survey", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"e6da4b75-8e5b-51c4-807c-0c65baea38d9", kc_id:"e6da4b75-8e5b-51c4-807c-0c65baea38d9", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.476Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain syndicated data: a type of secondary data that is available through a subscription service Source: chapter 6 Key Terms, printed page 219; related section 6.3.", label:"Explain syndicated data", canonical_key:"explain_syndicated_data", status:"approved"}}] AS row
