n strategy where consumers must complete entry requirements for a chance to win something of value from a company Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.1.", label:"Explain enter to win", canonical_key:"explain_enter_to_win", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"cffe665c-138e-59f5-82ac-65ab9d3eb382", kc_id:"cffe665c-138e-59f5-82ac-65ab9d3eb382", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain fear appeals: campaigns that seek to change behavior through fear Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.4.", label:"Explain fear appeals", canonical_key:"explain_fear_appeals", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"9e373382-d5bc-5bd7-a71e-8942c6076b9d", kc_id:"9e373382-d5bc-5bd7-a71e-8942c6076b9d", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain feedback loop: notification that the message has been received between the sender and the receiver Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.2.", label:"Explain feedback loop", canonical_key:"explain_feedback_loop", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"20802c1a-0ea7-501b-8b25-f2dbb642a722", kc_id:"20802c1a-0ea7-501b-8b25-f2dbb642a722", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"process", definition:"Explain flighting promotion schedule: process of running a period of heavy promotions and then going for a period of time without any promotional messaging Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.1.", label:"Explain flighting promotion schedule", canonical_key:"explain_flighting_promotion_schedule", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"cd4c591e-7cd9-55eb-9e7f-6e652bc104a4", kc_id:"cd4c591e-7cd9-55eb-9e7f-6e652bc104a4", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain frequency: number of times the target market is exposed to a promotion Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.4.", label:"Explain frequency", canonical_key:"explain_frequency", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"ee094cb8-3074-58fd-9406-e74b9fa1c5db", kc_id:"ee094cb8-3074-58fd-9406-e74b9fa1c5db", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"process", definition:"Explain integrated marketing communications: development and execution of multiple promotional methods that include a coordinated message Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.3.", label:"Explain integrated marketing communications", canonical_key:"explain_integrated_marketing_communications", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"1eec5dd1-e117-5986-98af-fa91adf7aee4", kc_id:"1eec5dd1-e117-5986-98af-fa91adf7aee4", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"process", definition:"Explain Internet/digital marketing: promotional method that utilizes the Internet and digital technology such as text messaging, phone applications, and social media to reach consumers Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.1.", label:"Explain Internet/digital marketing", canonical_key:"explain_internet_digital_marketing", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"2809356a-a9e6-5906-827b-e056be3a3e4d", kc_id:"2809356a-a9e6-5906-827b-e056be3a3e4d", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain key performance indicators (KPIs): methods of evaluating promotional campaigns Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.4.", label:"Explain key performance indicators (KPIs)", canonical_key:"explain_key_performance_indicators_kpis", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"b595df41-b482-5ad4-9ccb-43596251e3bb", kc_id:"b595df41-b482-5ad4-9ccb-43596251e3bb", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain medium: various methods of communicating with a target audience; may include broadcast, print, outdoor, and other forms Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.4.", label:"Explain medium", canonical_key:"explain_medium", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"470014ce-f850-5fbf-acc4-5348c2f7248c", kc_id:"470014ce-f850-5fbf-acc4-5348c2f7248c", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"apply", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"method", definition:"Apply message strategy: method of developing a message based on how the message will best tie the brand to the target market Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.4.", label:"Apply message strategy", canonical_key:"apply_message_strategy", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"73444ba6-27ed-5071-950f-057ea0fa82ff", kc_id:"73444ba6-27ed-5071-950f-057ea0fa82ff", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain moral appeal: information communicated to the consumer to appeal to their sense of right and wrong Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.4.", label:"Explain moral appeal", canonical_key:"explain_moral_appeal", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"153f8721-4b29-5cf8-80f2-1af2a1528092", kc_id:"153f8721-4b29-5cf8-80f2-1af2a1528092", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain noise: unplanned distractions that interfere with the communication between a sender and a receiver Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.2.", label:"Explain noise", canonical_key:"explain_noise", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"a6d9516f-e8e6-5ee7-9eeb-c2af298bbeeb", kc_id:"a6d9516f-e8e6-5ee7-9eeb-c2af298bbeeb", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"domain", definition:"Explain paid sponsorship: when a person promoting a product is paid by the company to make the endorsement Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.5.", label:"Explain paid sponsorship", canonical_key:"explain_paid_sponsorship", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"9ba82f5d-8c04-53ce-863b-3e6ad27da954", kc_id:"9ba82f5d-8c04-53ce-863b-3e6ad27da954", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"process", definition:"Explain personal selling: one-to-one communication between the seller and the buyer; used to inform and persuade the buyer Source: chapter 13 Key Terms, printed page 467; related section 13.1.", label:"Explain personal selling", canonical_key:"explain_personal_selling", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"52403fc2-2c36-533d-b487-574d96db9e9f", kc_id:"52403fc2-2c36-533d-b487-574d96db9e9f", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloo