.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"process", definition:"Explain innovative marketing: Developing or improving offerings and marketing approaches to create customer value, discussed among the sustainable marketing principles in section 19.4. Avoid reading the glossary’s emphasis on media as an exhaustive definition of innovation. Source: chapter 19 Key Terms, printed page 665; related section 19.4.", label:"Explain innovative marketing", canonical_key:"explain_innovative_marketing", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"ef1398a7-2ae4-5255-81d7-d9ea040539e6", kc_id:"ef1398a7-2ae4-5255-81d7-d9ea040539e6", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"process", definition:"Explain mission-driven marketing: marketing strategies that align purpose and brand by using the corporate core mission and purpose as their focus Source: chapter 19 Key Terms, printed page 665; related section 19.5.", label:"Explain mission-driven marketing", canonical_key:"explain_mission_driven_marketing", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"7a5b66da-e62a-5bca-a60c-6111af9c2449", kc_id:"7a5b66da-e62a-5bca-a60c-6111af9c2449", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"apply", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"method", definition:"Apply purpose-driven strategy: strategy in which companies work to make a difference in their communities through their decisions and support of environmental programs Source: chapter 19 Key Terms, printed page 665; related section 19.5.", label:"Apply purpose-driven strategy", canonical_key:"apply_purpose_driven_strategy", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"1593b234-b279-5e72-ae68-ba8d5fad95e9", kc_id:"1593b234-b279-5e72-ae68-ba8d5fad95e9", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T1