uring value in return. Source: section 1.1, printed page 12.", label:"Trace the five-step marketing process", canonical_key:"trace_the_five_step_marketing_process", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"375bbc62-943a-58b2-8919-cc5e8b89fbac", kc_id:"375bbc62-943a-58b2-8919-cc5e8b89fbac", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"understand", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"relationship", definition:"Explain how underlying needs, culturally shaped wants, and willingness and ability to buy differ in identifying a viable offering. Source: section 1.1, printed page 12.", label:"Distinguish needs, wants, and demand", canonical_key:"distinguish_needs_wants_and_demand", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"e1f03f25-950b-52b0-912d-bbc765ab6247", kc_id:"e1f03f25-950b-52b0-912d-bbc765ab6247", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"apply", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"method", definition:"Assess minds, minutes, machinery, materials, and money as internal resources constraining marketing execution. Source: section 1.3, printed page 22.", label:"Apply the five internal Ms", canonical_key:"apply_the_five_internal_ms", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"c4cbc101-8cbe-5a75-92e3-54887794c1ff", kc_id:"c4cbc101-8cbe-5a75-92e3-54887794c1ff", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"analyze", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.59Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"relationship", definition:"Classify suppliers, intermediaries, customers, competitors, and publics separately from broad political, economic, social, technological, legal, and environmental forces. Source: section 1.3, printed page 22.", label:"Separate microenvironment and macroenvironment", canonical_key:"separate_microenvironment_and_macroenvironment", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"5db0bf10-886c-53f7-b26d-