UNWIND [{concept_id:"a80e55a9-7313-5fe2-b347-4fcc27256b6e", kc_id:"a80e55a9-7313-5fe2-b347-4fcc27256b6e", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"analyze", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.749Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"method", definition:"Source assessment in chapter 9, What Do Marketers Do?, task 3. Case context: A product manager is the keeper of a brand. Their job is to develop the product strategy—the what, where, when, and how much of a product. Then, a product manager coordinates a cross-functional team of professionals from marketing, development, finance, legal, operations, manufacturing, supply chain, and more to…. Learner task: What is the career path that led them to this role? Product managers can be found at companies of all sizes, including both B2B and B2C. You can use your network on LinkedIn or your professor to source an interviewee.", label:"Ch. 9 What Do Marketers Do?, task 3: What is the career path that led them to this role", canonical_key:"ch_9_what_do_marketers_do_task_3_what_is_the_car", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"e94db53c-469b-54fd-8871-16c0fb45c223", kc_id:"e94db53c-469b-54fd-8871-16c0fb45c223", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"create", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.749Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"method", definition:"Source assessment in chapter 9, Marketing Plan Exercise, task 1. Learner task: Complete the following information about the company and products/services you chose to focus on as you develop the marketing plan throughout the course. You may need to conduct research in order to obtain necessary information. Instructions: Using the Marketing Plan Template file you created from the Marketing and Customer Value assignment and expanded upon in Strategic Planning in Marketing, Market Segmentation, Targeting, and Positioning, and Marketing Research and Market Intelligence, complete the following section of your marketing plan: • Marketing Strategy: Product Submit the marketing plan to your instructor for grading and feedback.", label:"Ch. 9 Marketing Plan Exercise, task 1: Complete the following information about the company and products/services you chose…", canonical_key:"ch_9_marketing_plan_exercise_task_1_complete_the", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"f0e70e2c-515b-5a76-908c-8146ee51fa6a", kc_id:"f0e70e2c-515b-5a76-908c-8146ee51fa6a", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"evaluate", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.749Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"method", definition:"Source assessment in chapter 9, Closing Company Case, task 1. Case context: Ramblewood In 2018, husband and wife duo Zach and Riley McDonald began getting a flood of requests to help with events. Each of them individually had significant talents. They were great foodies, and they understood good food both in taste and in presentation. Their combined skill for aesthetics in design, display,…. Learner task: Ramblewood provides many benefits to its customers. What are the four levels of product provided by Ramblewood?", label:"Ch. 9 Closing Company Case, task 1: Ramblewood provides many benefits to its customers", canonical_key:"ch_9_closing_company_case_task_1_ramblewood_prov", status:"approved"}}, {concept_id:"288d5dfc-f180-53d0-86c2-71e91c2532e3", kc_id:"288d5dfc-f180-53d0-86c2-71e91c2532e3", properties:{course_id:"8a9fefac-e5b9-49dd-935c-88cfd1929e26", bloom_level:"evaluate", updated_at:datetime('2026-09-20T10:16:37.749Z'), level:"atomic_concept", concept_type:"method", definition:"Source assessment in chapter 9, Closing Company Case, task 2. Case context: Ramblewood In 2018, husband and wife duo Zach and Riley McDonald began getting a flood of requests to help with events. Each of them individually had significant talents. They were great foodies, and they understood good food both in taste and in presentation. Their combined skill 