 Hardware dominates by number of locations and customer satisfaction.49 What started in 1924 as a way for…. Learner task: What is the retail classification of Ace Hardware?", label:"Ch. 18 Closing Company Case, task 2: What is the retail classification of Ace Hardware", canonical_key:"ch_18_closing_company_case_task_2_what_is_the_re", status:"approved"}}] AS row
